@startuml component-transport
title Transport-Agnostic Card Management — per-provider CM_CARD_LIST (PC/SC + SICCT)

package "apdu-lib (transport-neutral)" {
  interface CardReaderPort
  class CmCardList
  class CardObject
  class CardObjectFactory
  class CardPresenceCoordinator
  class CardListAggregator
  interface CardListProvider
  class CardSessionService
  class ComfortSignatureService
  class EgkSessionLock
  class G2Pseudonym
  note bottom of CmCardList
    One instance PER provider
    (never shared, FR-062).
    Holds CardObject entries,
    48h no-reuse blacklist.
  end note
}

package "crypto-pcsc-lib" {
  class PcscCryptoProvider
  class PcscCardReaderPort
  class PcscReaderRegistry
  class PcscEjectHandler
  PcscCardReaderPort ..|> CardReaderPort
  PcscCryptoProvider ..|> CardListProvider
  PcscCryptoProvider *-- CmCardList : owns its own
  PcscReaderRegistry --> PcscCardReaderPort : poll (javax.smartcardio)
}

package "crypto-sicct-lib" {
  class SicctCryptoProvider
  class SicctCardReaderPort
  SicctCardReaderPort ..|> CardReaderPort
  SicctCryptoProvider ..|> CardListProvider
  SicctCryptoProvider *-- CmCardList : owns its own
  SicctCardReaderPort --> SicctChannel : sicct-lib terminal
}

package "konnektor-soap-server" {
  class KonnektorEventService
  KonnektorEventService --> CardListAggregator : getCards()
}

CardListAggregator --> CardListProvider : aggregate each\nprovider's CmCardList
CardPresenceCoordinator --> CardObjectFactory
CardObjectFactory --> CardObject
CardObjectFactory --> CardReaderPort : reads ICCSN / EF.Version

note as N1
  apdu-lib MUST NOT depend on sicct-lib (FR-061, SC-019).
  APDU transmission only behind CardReaderPort in the providers.
  Unified GetCards = aggregation across per-provider lists (FR-064).
end note
@enduml
